<https://example.org/openevidence/questions/q_cirrhosis_treatment> a holon:ClinicalQuestionHolon ;
    oe:questionText "What is the recommended first-line pharmacological treatment for Cirrhosis?"^^xsd:string ;
    oe:answerText "Previous studies suggest that anticoagulation may reduce the risk of portal hypertension (PHT)-related complications and improve survival in patients with cirrhosis. This study aimed to evaluate the efficacy and safety of the direct oral anticoagulant rivaroxaban in patients with cirrhosis."^^xsd:string ;
